2.
Definitions.
- In this Act, unless the context otherwise requires,-
(1)
"Commission" means the Assam Finance Commission constituted by the Governor pursuant to sub-clause (1) of Article
243-I of the Constitution;
(2)
"Government" means the Government of Assam;
(3)
"Governor" means the Governor of Assam;
(4)
"Member" means the Member of the Assam Finance Commission;
(5)
"Chairman" means the Chairman of the Assam Finance Commission;
(6)
"Member Secretary" means a Member of the Assam Finance Commission, specially designated as Member Secretary.
